  "description": "Gravel riding means dust filling the lungs, the dry clatter of stone against the derailleur and the silent groans of full-on effort. It's also a new vision of performance that resonates brilliantly with the new Crosshill CF. This carbon gravel bike is made for movie sets, like Mad Max or Dune, as you like! It's also a weapon designed to accompany your greatest sporting conquests, whether on a long distance road trip, a personal challenge or a group bikepacking expedition. Everything about the Crosshill CF is in tune with your exploits, with the certainty of creating some of the best memories in your life. That's the case for Romain, Jiri and Mathieu, whose crazy project to cross the Canary Islands on gravel bikes sums up the exceptional abilities of this piece of equipment.",
